This product imports attention-manifest-protocol 0.6.3 from npm, Copyright
2026 Eloy Kim, licensed under Apache-2.0. It bundles the published protocol,
scanner, registry, search, runtime, governance, signing and domain implementations,
together with all published JSON Schemas. AMP wire version is 0.1.
Host bindings and authorization boundaries are described in docs/AMP-INTEGRATION.md.

At the user's request, this product includes a source snapshot of
deepseek-coordination 0.23.2, Copyright 2026 Eloy Kim, under Apache-2.0.
Its 24 agent tool implementations and eight skills are ported with separate
Codex host adapters. Source hashes and boundaries are documented in
docs/COORDINATION-TOOLS.md. Original notices and bundled dependency licenses are
retained in assets/COORDINATION_THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md inside the plugin.

The React interface uses periodicity-react 0.1.15 (Apache-2.0), React and React
DOM (MIT), and the MCP Apps client SDK. Published schemas are validated with
Ajv and ajv-formats (MIT). Build tools bundle dependencies for installation;
the server runtime does not fetch code from npm.

Bundled server license texts and upstream notices are retained in
plugins/codex-coordination/assets/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md. Bundled frontend
license texts are in plugins/codex-coordination/app/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md.
